flowchart TB
  START["PROPOSED ONLY<br/>Receive incoming ticket and requested operation"]
  START -->|actor and target| AUTH["Authenticate actor and tenant<br/>Retrieve one authoritative ticket by unique ID"]
  AUTH -->|unique authorized target| ATTR["Validate critical immutable attributes<br/>Expected revision and allowed field changes"]
  ATTR -->|attributes agree| SCORES["Calculate lexical and semantic similarity<br/>Require independently calibrated thresholds"]
  SCORES -->|both thresholds pass| APPROVE["Deterministic authorization<br/>Explicit confirmation bound to action digest"]
  APPROVE -->|approved action| TX["Transaction<br/>Reserve actor-scoped idempotency key<br/>Recheck revision and authorization<br/>Execute allowlisted change"]
  TX -->|committed| VERIFY["Read back exact target and approved fields<br/>Audit actor, reason, policy and versions"]
  AUTH -->|failure or unavailable validation| REJECT["Reject or defer before mutation<br/>Audit reason; manual review"]
  ATTR -->|mismatch or ambiguity| REJECT
  SCORES -->|low score or model failure| REJECT
  APPROVE -->|not authorized| REJECT
  VERIFY -->|uncertain external result| RECONCILE["Reconcile before retry<br/>Outbox and provider idempotency for future integrations"]
  RULE["Similarity cannot establish identity<br/>LLM output cannot authorize execution"]
  RULE -.->|governs| APPROVE
